{"ref":"BDB, מְרִיא","hw":"מְרִיא","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מְרִיא</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>fatling, fatlings</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:13\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.13\">2 S 6:13</a> + 3 times; pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְרִיאִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.11\">Is 1:11</a>, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְרִיאֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 39:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.39.18\">Ez 39:18</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְרִיאֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 5:22\" href=\"/Amos.5.22\">Am 5:22</a>;—<em>fatling:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵגֶל וּכְפִיר וּמְרִיא</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 11:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.11.6\">Is 11:6</a>; elsewhere only of sacrificial animals, <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁלֶם מְרִיאֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 5:22\" href=\"/Amos.5.22\">Am 5:22</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עֹלוֹת</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִנְחֹתֵיכֶם</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵלֶב מְרִיאִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.11\">Is 1:11</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עֹלוֹת אֵילִים</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּם פָּרִים</span>, etc.); <span dir=\"rtl\">מְרִיאֵי בָשָׁן</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 39:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.39.18\">Ez 39:18</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּרִים</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵילִים</span>, etc.); also sg. coll., <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּזְבַּח שׁוֹר וּמְרִיא</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:13\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.13\">2 S 6:13</a>, so (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">צֹאן וּבָקָר</span>) <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.9\">1 K 1:9</a>, and (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוֹר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">צֹאן</span>) v <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:19\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:25\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.25\">25</a>.","next":"BDB, מֻרְאָה","prev":"BDB, מרא"}